before:
```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Sky");
        System.out.println("Sea");
    }
}
```

after:
Follow the two printing instructions in order. The program prints Sky, then Sea on the next line.

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Sky");
        System.out.println("Sea");
    }
}
```
